{title: Aake Teri Baahon Me}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]Aake teri baho me
[F]Har sham lage sinduri
[F]Mere mann [F#m]ko mahkaya
[Am]Tere mann [F]ki kasturi
[Am]Mehki hawaye [F]udata aachal
[Am]Lat ghugharale [F]kale badal
[F]Prem sudha naino se barase
[F]Pi lene ko jivan tarase
[F]Baho me dhas lene de
[F]Prit ke chumban dene de
[F]In adharo se [F#m]chhalak na jaye
[Am]Yauvan [F]ras anguri
[Am]Sunderta ka [F]bahata sagar
[Am]Tere liye hai [F]rup ke badal
[F]Indradhanush ke rang churau
[F]Teri zulmi mang sajau
[F]Do phulo ke khilane ka
[F]Waqt yahi hai milane ka
[F]Aja milake [F#m]aaj mita de
[Am]Thodi si [F]ye duri
